meta {
  name: tables
  seq: 12
}

docs {
  Run auth (adminToken, waiterToken, kitchenToken) first. Run the requests in order.
  Everything happens on table 50. The setup request frees it (200, or 409 if it's already free), the last request closes it again: every run starts and ends with table 50 free.
  50 = the default tableCount (restored by the settings folder and the seed).
}
